{"title":"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/3/5b3ae5f3534163b32c6d157307c8ea85f612ea20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = .123456789101112....998999$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"249\" height=\"13\" />, where the digits are obtained by writing the integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/0/0705411d92671faf1fe5602cfef8f353c7f0f83d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$999$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> in order. \nThe <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/2/7f285f05f4d501652175d1befe9189270b28e1ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1983$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /><sup>rd</sup> digit to the right of the decimal point is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/9/9d9daa87268c931e4ef29dbb1de9ae64168ce6c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 3\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 5\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 7\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"348\" height=\"17\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We consider the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/2/7f285f05f4d501652175d1befe9189270b28e1ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1983$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> digits, letting the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/2/7f285f05f4d501652175d1befe9189270b28e1ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1983$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /><sup>rd</sup> digit be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. We can break the string of digits into three segments: let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> denote <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/f/15f923698eb1048b7cdece9d22a24a6802e03bd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$123456789$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" /> (the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit numbers), let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> denote <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b4eb83a7ae7e64d2b1d527b98d8f460252a8da6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1011...9899$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"87\" height=\"13\" /> (the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit numbers), and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> denote <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/1/b71da22449cf20a9cf587536f7f6a7e680b0131d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100101...z$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"77\" height=\"13\" /> (the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit numbers). Clearly there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> digits in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />; in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/6/e063b56aa31ad7c0a7ef8652bb78d2b20324b24a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99-10+1 = 90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"134\" height=\"15\" /> numbers, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/a/07a8bacf5ebc0d5fc6708c093a6d43c279ad2d27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90 \\cdot 2 = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"91\" height=\"13\" /> digits. This leaves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/3/8238e44cdd3fae16510f97bf67145bf5a8719cfd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1983 - 9 - 180 = 1794$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"177\" height=\"13\" /> digits in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/f/21f08ae3608b8026b7677b8fbcfa0b52a209f68b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1794 = 3 \\cdot 598$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"109\" height=\"13\" /> with no remainder, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> consists of precisely the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/f/4df930bc514e2cdc08c462c45602b49f5280e7a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$598$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit numbers. Since the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/f/4df930bc514e2cdc08c462c45602b49f5280e7a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$598$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /><sup>th</sup> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/4/2b4efc14c6518c3a2512cec527d048ea28a29091.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 + 598 - 1 = 697$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"159\" height=\"14\" />, so as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is the last digit, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/e/6cecfe394f16d2d6d7bc6844d2d845b2a014f077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME\" title=\"1983 AHSME\">1983 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1983 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1983\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1983 AHSME P